# Setup for the inc-kgzx "Undeath to Death" pool check, starting from a LOADED
# character: the fixture orc-priest-seed1-opt0822 (INCURSION_LOAD), an orc
# priest of Aiswin at Priest 1. This is tools/keys/undeath-to-death-setup.keys
# with the character-creation include (and the ESC that dismissed its last
# message) removed, because a generated character was seed-dependent: on seed
# 404 the rolled attributes make chargen ask a question the script does not
# answer (inc-b4l3g.38). The rest is unchanged: wizard-mode switches, ten levels
# of Free Advancement to character level 11, and Learn Any Spell.
#
# The loaded character arrives at (81,76); the scene is laid relative to him.
#
# NOT RUN DIRECTLY; included by undeath-to-death-pool.keys.
w y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN*2 SPACE
DOWN*5 SPACE
DOWN*3 SPACE
UP SPACE
ESC
# Wizard Sight can raise appraisal messages that end in a more-prompt, which
# would swallow the next keys.
@while "more --" SPACE
d
G
@while "Bonus To Which Attribute" a
@while "Choose a feat" a
@while "Choose a bonus" a
@while "Focus on which Weapon" a
@while "You feel" ESC
@while "more --" SPACE
